Package: aradR
Type: Package
Title: Modern R Client and Toolkit for the Czech National Bank ARAD API
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Simona", "Malovana", email = "simona.malovana@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: Provides a reliability-first interface to the Czech National Bank
    ARAD API for discovering indicators, retrieving and validating time series,
    working with metadata and snapshots, and building reproducible data
    workflows. The package is designed for robust handling of long requests,
    parsing diagnostics, missing values, retries, caching, and automated tests.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Language: en
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
Imports:
    httr2,
    readr,
    tibble
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/simonamalovana/aradR
BugReports: https://github.com/simonamalovana/aradR/issues
